Usage: vifstab verify [flags...] [operands...]

Verify fstab read-only with the caller's credentials.

Subcommands:
    help  Print this help message
    usage Print this usage message


Flags:
    --file string       (default: "/etc/fstab")   File to verify or capture; -
                                                  selects stdin.
    --snapshot string   (default: "")             Verify an isolated TXTAR
                                                  snapshot; - selects stdin.
    --capture string    (default: "")             Save a private TXTAR support
                                                  case, including failed
                                                  verification; - selects
                                                  stdout.
    --static            (default: false)          Run host-independent checks;
                                                  live observations remain
                                                  unchecked/unknown.
    --unredacted        (default: false)          Retain sensitive values in an
                                                  explicit capture.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
